<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Dr. Afshana Ashraf | Physiotherapist</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f7fbfa;
      color: #183b3a;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: #0f766e;
      color: white;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 14px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 70px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e6fffa, #f7fbfa);
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      color: #115e59;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      background: #0f766e;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      padding: 55px 20px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    section h2 {
      text-align: center;
      color: #115e59;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .about {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #0f766e;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .contact {
      background: #e6fffa;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #134e4a;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px 15px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero h2 {
        font-size: 29px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 40px 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Dr. Afshana Ashraf, PT</h1>
    <p>Physiotherapy & Home Visit Services</p>
  </header>

  <div class="hero">
    <h2>Move Better. Feel Better.</h2>

    <p>
      Professional physiotherapy care at the comfort of your home.
      Personalized treatment designed around your needs.
    </p>

    <a class="button" href="#contact">Book a Home Visit</a>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>About Me</h2>

    <div class="about">
      <p>
        I am Dr. Afshana Ashraf, a physiotherapist providing
        personalized physiotherapy care and home-based rehabilitation.
        My goal is to help patients improve movement, reduce pain,
        regain strength and become more independent in daily activities.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Physiotherapy Services</h2>

    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Pain Management</h3>
        <p>
          Physiotherapy management for back pain, neck pain,
          joint pain and muscular problems.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Orthopaedic Rehab</h3>
        <p>
          Rehabilitation after injuries, fractures, surgeries
          and orthopaedic conditions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Neurological Rehab</h3>
        <p>
          Exercise-based rehabilitation to improve strength,
          balance, mobility and functional independence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Geriatric Physiotherapy</h3>
        <p>
          Safe exercises and mobility training for older adults
          to maintain independence and confidence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Home Physiotherapy</h3>
        <p>
          Personalized physiotherapy sessions delivered
          conveniently at your home.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Exercise Therapy</h3>
        <p>
          Individualized therapeutic exercises for strength,
          flexibility, balance and mobility.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Why Choose Home Physiotherapy?</h2>

    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🏠 Convenient</h3>
        <p>Receive treatment in the comfort of your own home.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🎯 Personalized</h3>
        <p>Treatment and exercises are tailored to your condition.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>💪 Functional</h3>
        <p>Focus on improving movement and everyday activities.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact">

    <h2>Book a Home Visit</h2>

    <p>
      Interested in physiotherapy at home?
      Get in touch to discuss your requirements.
    </p>

    <!-- Replace the number below with your WhatsApp number -->
    <a class="button"
       href="https://wa.me/91XXXXXXXXXX"
       target="_blank">
       WhatsApp Me
    </a>

    <br><br>

    <p>
      📍 Home Physiotherapy Sessions<br>
      📞 Contact for appointment
    </p>

  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Dr. Afshana Ashraf, PT</p>
    <p>Physiotherapy & Home Visit Services</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>